This plugin allows you to cut the file on pieces of the given size. 

Installation: just copy contents of archive to directory FAR\Plugins\CutFile 
and restart FAR. 

Usage: place the cursor on the file, press <F11> to call the Plugins Menu,
select Cut File. After the answer to a question on a size of pieces in 
kilobytes or bytes in current directory file pieces and the bat-file 
with the commands of assembly will be created.

To cancel creation of the bat-file, and as the notification at the end of 
the cutting, is possible through Plugin Configuration:
	<F9>/Options/Plugins Configuration/Cut File.

Good luck,

